  "details": "We have worlds and avatars. How about a new thing that people can upload separately? The item box is an item you can spawn in that is not tied to your avatar but its own separate object. It should be more restrictive with fewer materials, face count, and particles. People can then share items in worlds which can be saved or uploaded to your account. This would also allow more customization to vrchat to people who do not have a strong unity knowledge. I am sure it would also require a new safety setting that disables items or worlds that restrict items.",
